{
 "id": "ma-chop-whipsaw-01",
 "title": {
  "en": "MA Crossover Whipsaw in a Range",
  "bn": "Range-এ MA crossover-এর whipsaw"
 },
 "symbol": "EURUSD",
 "timeframe": "H4",
 "mode": "synthetic",
 "type": "pattern",
 "bias": "neutral",
 "outcome": "loss",
 "tags": [
  "moving-average",
  "crossover",
  "whipsaw",
  "range"
 ],
 "module": "07-technical-indicators",
 "lessonSlugs": [
  "01-moving-averages-crossover"
 ],
 "caption": {
  "en": "Price swings sideways; EMA 9 keeps crossing EMA 21. Each cross is a signal, and each one reverses before it pays.",
  "bn": "দাম sideways ঘোরে; EMA 9 বারবার EMA 21 কাটে। প্রতিটি cross একটি signal, কিন্তু লাভ আসার আগেই উল্টে যায়।"
 },
 "notes": {
  "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
  "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
 },
 "explanation": {
  "en": "Moving averages lag. In a range the lag is exactly what costs money: the signal arrives after the move is already over.",
  "bn": "Moving average পিছিয়ে থাকে। Range-এ এই lag-ই টাকা খায়: signal আসে চাল শেষ হওয়ার পরে।"
 },
 "keyTakeaways": [
  {
   "en": "A crossover without a trend is a coin flip with a spread",
   "bn": "Trend ছাড়া crossover মানে spread-সহ একটি মুদ্রা-টস"
  }
 ],
